# Store and check out text files with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Dockerfiles, shell snippets, YAML and Python run inside Linux containers and CI;
# CRLF there breaks shebangs and some parsers. PowerShell scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
